    "detailed_description": "Sleeping quality is important to all of us.<br />\r\nHaving a good night of sleep makes you energized to complete your tasks, overcome your obstacles and have fun with your loved ones during the day.<br />\r\nHowever there are always noisy and inconsiderate neighbors who disrupt your sleep.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIn this game, you will play the role of a university student, Daniel. He needs to complete his thesis. At the same time, he has to earn money to pay his rental. <br />\r\nAll these tasks require a refreshed mind, however, his noisy neighbors keep him awake at night.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nLet's help Daniel to investigate causes of the noise and come up with solutions to reduce it.<br />\r\nHopefully Daniel can graduate in time without being kicked out by\u00a0his\u00a0landlord!",
    "about_the_game": "Sleeping quality is important to all of us.<br />\r\nHaving a good night of sleep makes you energized to complete your tasks, overcome your obstacles and have fun with your loved ones during the day.<br />\r\nHowever there are always noisy and inconsiderate neighbors who disrupt your sleep.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIn this game, you will play the role of a university student, Daniel. He needs to complete his thesis. At the same time, he has to earn money to pay his rental. <br />\r\nAll these tasks require a refreshed mind, however, his noisy neighbors keep him awake at night.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nLet's help Daniel to investigate causes of the noise and come up with solutions to reduce it.<br />\r\nHopefully Daniel can graduate in time without being kicked out by\u00a0his\u00a0landlord!",
